"type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"2つにしてRelease Policy叩きつけるで良いんだけど","ts":"1629257227.227200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Y1Ae"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6c2eabe-96ec-4a14-bfc0-f81f28dd9ecb","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"ライブラリのサポートGoバージョンが半年なのはかわいそうだから3つサポートしようかなという印象","ts":"1629257181.226300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rru"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6b299b1-e211-4f45-bbaf-76fa69911197","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"(Ebiten は ~os.UserConfigDir とか使いたかったので~ Go 1.15 にしました)","ts":"1629257105.224600","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1629268807.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kR9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45fb6ad6-bc4a-437d-b6bd-dbed5c9c0e17","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ずっと1.11とか1.12はつらい","ts":"1629257100.224400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VWeU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa5a740c-4803-4c90-ae43-26db5f18f0cc","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"App Engine や Debian latest を基準に Go バージョンを決めると安全だったりするかもしれない、でもなー","ts":"1629257085.224000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gDLt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd9368af-6a80-4d2c-af77-8b29b6f446b8","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"勘違いはなはだしかった・・・","ts":"1629257050.223400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XHQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4edb214-8b9a-4fbe-ac83-d86452da1b07","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ん、そんなことはないと思いますけど… (context, plugin, etc.)","ts":"1629257031.223200","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1629257055.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ENBD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"397342a6-1e88-410e-af9f-0a55c1f9a0c9","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"embedはGo史上初の標準パッケージ追加なんですよね","ts":"1629257009.222800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C8dla"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2280f4b-3339-47f5-b2db-28cc00abff09","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"実際 go:embed 使えてないですね。今回で使うかどうかも未だに悩む","ts":"1629256599.222100","thread_ts":"1629254753.220000","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VYm"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"1623cc89-4c72-405e-9bfd-dbf2fc768fcf","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"アプリケーションコードは自分の好きなタイミングでバージョン上げれますが、ライブラリは難しいですね…","ts":"1629254753.220000","thread_ts":"1629254753.220000","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+eQ"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"40355fb2-decc-410b-97de-aba7985ade21","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"go.mod の Go バージョン指定のおかげで少しずつ互換性壊しながら変更が進められるのか、なるほど? (Go コンパイラが過去の挙動を全部エミュレートする限り)","ts":"1629255106.220900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UIEl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1623cc89-4c72-405e-9bfd-dbf2fc768fcf","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"アプリケーションコードは自分の好きなタイミングでバージョン上げれますが、ライブラリは難しいですね…","ts":"1629254753.220000","thread_ts":"1629254753.220000","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+eQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6695cb6c-169e-4561-b1fc-ba6a47b22dc6","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"go:embed 入れたりすると分断が起きる","ts":"1629253955.219300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8ZLJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97aa9d03-c1e3-43f1-812c-25522786aed8","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"以前は Go はサポートするバージョンのレンジがだいぶ広かったけど、さすがにこういうの入ってくると狭くなるなぁ。","ts":"1629252608.218700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UG8b1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a5bfab8-29ba-45d5-9fad-b4ec30225d45","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"\u003chttp://golang.org/design/draft-gobuild|golang.org/design/draft-gobuild\u003e ベースの知識ですが`go.mod` が `go 1.17` であれば `go fmt ./...` が旧形式を消すということになります。 `go.mod` の `go` ディレクティブが `1.16` 以下なら両方メンテする必要がある。Go 1.18がリリースされてライブラリが1.16を切っていいなら消して良いと思う。","ts":"1629252574.218100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fPp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d1513a9-14f4-4714-bd03-b174a758d6a7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なのでどこかで `// +build` の書き方は捨てたい。その捨てられるタイミングがいつなのか、が気になる。","ts":"1629252539.217400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qrS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"562ea6d4-e77d-49f7-aed6-699acec3715d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"たしか今は両方書けるんですよね。どっちが優先か知らんけど。","ts":"1629252522.216800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O8KT2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e47c010-6e26-4399-957f-c5bd87524c82","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"でも `// +build` と両方の書き方をずっと維持するのは、メンテコストから考えて悪手","ts":"1629252467.215000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dPi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b8d2381-0cfe-4ca8-b422-9a7f9c47cad8","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"現時点で `//go:build` だけ書くって選択肢はまずいよね。go1.16が切れちゃうから。だから併記はほぼmust","ts":"1629252415.214100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ozueb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bcb12729-879c-454a-9a6c-e8f5741a015f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いや質問の仕方がおかしいな","ts":"1629252373.213500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H+o="}]},{"client_msg_id":"8dbceaa0-d399-4a16-b88b-f6d0f3b85266","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"両方書かれてるとき、どうなるんやろか","ts":"1629252361.213300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kS6Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13117110-50fd-4b1d-bb11-0387093aff46","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"おそらく go1.X の間は使えるんじゃないですかね。","ts":"1629251558.212500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ohzl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a25cf4e4-d208-47ab-b409-33a9ee0a1ae5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"go1.17と1.16がactiveな間に両方併記して、go1.18と1.17になったら `// +build` 消せばよいのかな?","ts":"1629247878.212100","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1629247889.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RmsCn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a541248b-e1b9-42d0-9e37-8ce989d8feff","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"`// +build` 使ってるパッケージが `//go:build` に移行するのはどういうスケジュールにするのが良いんだろう?","ts":"1629247823.211000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V7FR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5cd94bae-37a3-476f-b568-e555c1a61245","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"misspell の競合?","ts":"1629214305.210300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VdP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57f7440b-4cee-4042-b8d1-9e94e705e7d5","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/crate-ci/typos\u003e\nこれ使いました。","ts":"1629213713.209900","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"crate-ci/typos","id":1,"title":"crate-ci/typos","text":"Source code spell checker","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"325","short":true},{"title":